      "text": "[7:15PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nCarter Bridge is free flow of traffic in both directions.\nNnamdi Azikiwe Street is smooth movement from Tom Jones intersection to Idumota.\nOyebanji Roundabout is good traffic flow connecting Adeniji Adele Road via Oba's Palace and Police Post.\nIlubinrin to Carter Bridge is fast-moving traffic inward towards Ijora, Iddo, and Oyingbo.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
