      "text": "[8:03PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nIyana Oworo to Ilaje is free flow of traffic.\nIyana Oworo to Gbagada is good movement, including return journey via Charly Boy.\nBariga Axis is free flow of traffic from Deeper Life to Tantalizer, New Garage, and Baale.\nMuritala to Bariga Roundabout is smooth movement.\nIlaje Chemist to UNILAG Gate is good movement.\n\nReturn journey from UNILAG Gate to Baale is good.\n\nOfficers are still on the ground managing traffic effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
